  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Qing Yue Zhi Cheng is named a bloodline descendant of Qing Yue clan’s first supreme elder, Qing Yue An.",
      "chapters": [
        1488
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qing_yue_zhi_cheng",
        "fac_qing_yue_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a middle aged man in a blue robe.",
      "chapters": [
        1690
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He appears with Song Qi Yuan and Hua Cai Yun as Eastern Sea righteous path rank eights facing Duke Long after Dragon Palace surfaces. Narration groups Song Qi Yuan, Qing Yue An, and others as Eastern Sea righteous path making coordinated decisions, and notes Eastern Sea’s wealth yields the highest number of rank eight Gu Immortals among the five regions.",
      "chapters": [
        1690
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dragon-palace-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_qi_yuan",
        "char_hua_cai_yun",
        "fac_eastern_sea_righteous_path",
        "char_duke_long",
        "house_dragon_palace",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Waiting in the sky as Dragon Palace charges out of the sea, he is again named Qing Yue clan’s first supreme elder. He uses immortal killer move Myriad Mountain Ranges: a phantom mountain descends and mountain ranges encircle Dragon Palace, obstructing it until Shi Miao’s acid water melts a path.",
      "chapters": [
        1692
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "obstructs-dragon-palace",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_myriad_mountain_ranges",
        "char_shi_miao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later obstructs Dragon Palace again during the scramble of rank eights.",
      "chapters": [
        1695
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "obstructs-dragon-palace",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is listed among Song Qi Yuan, Shen Cong Sheng, Zhang Yin, Granny Rong, Shi Miao, and others in the Eastern Sea rank eight gathering seeking Dragon Palace.",
      "chapters": [
        1700
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "gathering-after-duke-long",
